{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dsji5sne","slide":2,"text":"Young adults do not only need to record money. They need a recording method they can sustain.","textPreview":"Young adults do not only need to record money. They need a recording method they can sustain.","textChars":93,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,184,780,58]}
